WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,180
I even brought the dinner plate back.

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:05,180
These bodyguards of Big Boss are really talented people.

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:10,700
It smells so good

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,700
There is not enough in the day. Small amounts and many times. Don’t waste it.

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:22,700
We must cherish food even more in the future

6
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,700
Look at the way you eat. You've fooled the children.

7
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,700
Eating fruit in Pakistan

8
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:30,060
Aren't you standing here eating rice?

9
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:36,830
With so many people, a lot of food is consumed

10
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:39,150
We still have to find a way to replenish supplies.

11
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:49,800
If you can break a few, most people are still ordinary people.

12
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,830
The order in the city is not completely chaotic yet

13
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:53,830
No one wants to take the risk
